---
layout: layouts/page.njk
page_id: problems
page_width: medium
title: Sleep problems
band: standard
eyebrow: Step 2
heading: What's keeping you up?
summary: Open an area to see its topics, or search in your own words. Choose as many as sound like you.
---
{#-
  Sleep problems (SPEC §7.2; HANDOFF §6.3). M1a stub: every problem, grouped
  by area, as plain lists. This is the no-JavaScript baseline; M1b adds the
  accordion, the "When it happens" view and the live filter. Area sections
  have ids, so /problems/#core links to an area.
-#}
{%- set topicAreas = collections.problems | groupByArea(areas) -%}
<div class="area-list">
  {%- for area in topicAreas %}
  <section class="area-list__area" id="{{ area.area_id }}">
    <h2 class="area-list__name">{{ area.name }}</h2>
    <p class="area-list__description">{{ area.description }}</p>
    <ul class="area-list__problems" role="list">
      {%- for problem in area.problems %}
      <li><a class="area-list__link" href="{{ problem.url }}"><span class="area-list__title">{{ problem.title }}</span> <span class="area-list__statement">{{ problem.statement }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
